items/thm-componentwise-convergence-and-completeness.md:4:title: "For $n \\ge 1$ a sequence in $\\mathbb{R}^n$ converges iff each coordinate sequence converges, is Cauchy iff each coordinate sequence is Cauchy, and $\\mathbb{R}^n$ is complete in every norm"
